            "paragraph": "This version of CESM has a modern \u2018fast\u2019 climate sensitivity of 2.9 \u00b0C per CO2 doubling and a nearly constant \u2018slow\u2019 climate sensitivity (ESS) of 3.5 \u00b0C per CO2 doubling in the Eocene simulations used here.",
