            "target_entity_instance": "abundance of GDGTs",
            "target_entity_type": "Variable",
            "paragraph": "This fraction was then analysed by high-performance liquid chromatography (HPLC) and atmospheric pressure chemical ionization-mass spectrometry using an Agilent 1260 Infinity series HPLC system coupled to an Agilent 6130 single-quadrupole mass spectrometer at Utrecht University following Hopmans et al.31 to measure the abundance of GDGTs.",
